WEBVTT

00:00.808 --> 00:03.975
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

00:04.041 --> 00:09.841
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

00:09.908 --> 00:11.308
- Blllllaaaahhhh!
- 啦啦啦啦啦！

00:11.375 --> 00:13.408
Oh! Oh!
哦！哦！

00:13.475 --> 00:14.541
Whoa...
[tearing sound]
哇...
[撕裂声]

00:14.608 --> 00:15.775
Oh ha!
哦哈！

00:15.775 --> 00:17.208
Whoo!
[indistinct shouting]
呼！
[隐隐约约的喊叫]

00:17.275 --> 00:18.875
- Squidward. What do you
think the nurse
- 章鱼哥。你做什么
认为护士

00:18.941 --> 00:20.008
is doing to him
in there?
对他做的事
在那里？

00:20.075 --> 00:22.108
- It's called a "checkup."
- 这就是所谓的“检查”。

00:22.175 --> 00:23.908
It's an invasion
of your personal space
这是一次入侵
您的个人空间

00:23.975 --> 00:25.308
that's good for you.
这对你有好处。

00:25.375 --> 00:26.441
- Aaaaahhhh!
- 啊啊啊！

00:26.508 --> 00:27.675
- [gasp]
- Ah!
- [喘气]
- 啊！

00:27.775 --> 00:28.908
- [frightened sounds]
- [害怕的声音]

00:28.975 --> 00:29.941
Whoa!
哇！

00:30.008 --> 00:32.141
- Eee...
[SpongeBob shouting]
- 呃…
[海绵宝宝大喊]

00:32.208 --> 00:33.541
[chomping]
[咀嚼]

00:33.608 --> 00:35.341
Eee--aah!
哎呀——啊啊！

00:35.408 --> 00:37.275
[light music]
[轻音乐]

00:37.341 --> 00:39.275
[nonsense sounds]
[胡言乱语的声音]

00:39.341 --> 00:40.575
[giggling]
[咯咯笑]

00:40.641 --> 00:42.441
- Sir, please hold still.
- 先生，请保持不动。

00:42.508 --> 00:44.808
I need to check
your reflexes.
我需要检查
你的反应。

00:44.875 --> 00:47.475
- Sorry, nurse lady.
I've never had a checkup before.
- 对不起，护士小姐。
我以前从来没有做过检查。

00:47.541 --> 00:49.341
It's so much fun!
太有趣了！

00:49.408 --> 00:50.875
[dink]
[丁克]

00:50.941 --> 00:52.408
[high-pitched horn squeal]
[高亢的喇叭声]

00:52.475 --> 00:54.775
- [sighs]
You seem fine...
- [叹气]
你看起来很好...

00:54.841 --> 00:56.575
physically, at least.
至少在身体上是这样。

00:56.641 --> 00:59.475
Congratulations.
You pass.
恭喜。
你通过了。

00:59.541 --> 01:01.608
- Wow! Imagine
if it was this easy
- 哇！想象一下
如果这么简单的话

01:01.675 --> 01:03.041
to get your boating
license!
去划船
许可证！

01:03.108 --> 01:05.641
- Eh. The world
shudders at the thought.
- 呃。世界
一想到这里就不寒而栗。

01:05.775 --> 01:08.141
- Mr. Tentacles?!
- 触手先生？！

01:08.208 --> 01:10.508
- Finally!
Let's get this over with!
- 最后！
让我们结束这一切吧！

01:10.575 --> 01:12.175
- [whimpering]
Ooh...
- [呜咽]
哦...

01:12.241 --> 01:15.408
So, Boy-o...
how was it in there?
那么，小男孩...
那里怎么样？

01:15.475 --> 01:18.108
Anything I should be...
terrified of?
任何我应该...
害怕什么？

01:18.175 --> 01:21.075
- Oh, no, Mr. Krabs!
Getting a checkup is the best!
- 哦，不，蟹老板！
去检查一下是最好的！

01:21.141 --> 01:23.975
The nurse poked me
and prodded me
护士戳我
并刺激我

01:24.041 --> 01:25.675
and jabbed me...
[bell rings]
并戳了我...
[铃声响起]

01:25.775 --> 01:28.975
and pulled me
and twisted me.
并拉了我
并扭曲了我。

01:29.041 --> 01:30.775
And--
- Okay, okay.
还有——
- 好吧，好吧。

01:30.775 --> 01:32.241
That's enough.
[giggles]
这就够了。
[咯咯笑]

01:32.308 --> 01:33.841
- You want me to what?
- 你要我做什么？

01:33.908 --> 01:35.508
- [whimpering]
Ooh...
- [呜咽]
哦...

01:35.575 --> 01:36.908
- Fill this, please.
- 请填写这个。

01:36.975 --> 01:39.408
- Hmph.
[mumbling]
- 哼。
[咕哝]

01:43.175 --> 01:46.275
Could I get a little
privacy?
我可以得到一点吗
隐私？

01:47.308 --> 01:48.475
[mumbling]
[咕哝]

01:48.541 --> 01:51.308
[liquid whooshing]
[液体嘶嘶声]

01:51.375 --> 01:54.241
- Hmm...
good color.
- 嗯...
颜色好。

01:55.441 --> 01:58.075
Solid line fidelity.
实线保真度。

01:58.141 --> 02:00.208
The ink is a little
thick, though.
墨水有点
不过，很厚。

02:00.275 --> 02:02.208
- Hey!
- You just need to drink
- 嘿！
- 你只需要喝点酒

02:02.275 --> 02:03.375
more water.
更多的水。

02:03.441 --> 02:04.675
You pass.
你通过了。

02:04.775 --> 02:06.775
- Is there a...
- 有没有一个...

02:06.841 --> 02:08.775
Eugene Krabs?!
尤金·克拉布斯？！

02:08.808 --> 02:10.141
- Your turn, Mr. K.
- 轮到你了，K先生

02:10.208 --> 02:12.275
- [squeaks, panting]
- [吱吱声，气喘吁吁]

02:15.275 --> 02:19.308
[dramatic music]
[戏剧音乐]

02:19.375 --> 02:20.575
[bottle clatters]
[瓶子碰撞声]

02:20.641 --> 02:22.941
- Ha ha.
Looks like the old man
- 哈哈。
看起来像老头

02:23.008 --> 02:25.408
is scared of getting
his checkup.
害怕得到
他的检查。

02:25.475 --> 02:26.841
- This is no
laughing matter!
- 这不是
笑的事！

02:26.908 --> 02:29.508
Every employee
must get their checkup...
每一位员工
必须接受他们的检查...

02:29.575 --> 02:31.275
or the restaurant
will be closed--
或餐厅
将被关闭——

02:31.341 --> 02:36.108
under orders of the Bikini
Bottom Better Business Bureau.
在比基尼的命令下
底层商业改善局。

02:36.175 --> 02:39.241
- [gasps]
Not the...B.B.B.B.B!
- [喘气]
不是……B.B.B.B.B！

02:39.308 --> 02:40.441
- You heard her.
- 你听到她的声音了。

02:40.508 --> 02:42.108
The...bbbbbbbb!
那个...bbbbbbbb！

02:42.175 --> 02:44.875
- Perhaps we could reach
some sort of understanding.
- 也许我们可以到达
某种理解。

02:44.941 --> 02:46.508
- Oh, oh, I know!
- 哦，哦，我知道！

02:46.575 --> 02:48.541
We'll give Mr. Krabs
his checkup over the weekend
我们会给蟹老板
他周末检查

02:48.608 --> 02:50.575
and you just pick up
the results on Monday.
你只需拿起
周一出结果。

02:50.641 --> 02:53.108
heavenly chorus: * Ahh *
- [singsong] Everybody wins!
天堂合唱：*啊*
- [单曲] 每个人都赢了！

02:53.175 --> 02:55.175
- I was just gonna bribe her.
[cash register dings]
- 我只是想贿赂她
[收银机叮叮声]

02:55.241 --> 02:57.075
- Monday works.
- 周一上班。

02:57.141 --> 03:00.208
- Yay! We get to spend
the weekend together!
- 耶！我们可以花
一起过周末！

03:01.341 --> 03:03.775
- [humming]
Dodged that bullet!
- [嗡嗡声]
躲过了那颗子弹！

03:03.808 --> 03:05.441
- [gasps]
He's coming!
- [喘气]
他来了！

03:05.508 --> 03:08.375
- It says here the first
part of Krab's exam
- 这里说的是第一个
Krab 考试的一部分

03:08.441 --> 03:09.841
is the pinch test.
是捏测试。

03:09.908 --> 03:11.375
We just need to do it
我们只需要这样做

03:11.441 --> 03:13.641
in a way he doesn't know
he's being tested!
以他不知道的方式
他正在接受考验！

03:13.775 --> 03:15.008
- Way ahead a ya!
- 遥遥领先啊！

03:15.075 --> 03:16.841
We'll make him an offer
he can't resist!
我们会给他报价
他无法抗拒！

03:16.908 --> 03:19.575
- "Free money inside."
- “里面有免费的钱。”

03:19.641 --> 03:20.941
Ha. Not bad.
哈。不错。

03:21.008 --> 03:22.908
- Come on, before he sees us!
- 快点，在他看到我们之前！

03:22.975 --> 03:24.475
- [humming]
- [嗡嗡声]

03:24.541 --> 03:26.208
Huh? Free money, hey?
啊？免费的钱，嘿？

03:26.275 --> 03:29.108
[chuckles]
Don't mind if I do!
[笑声]
如果我这样做的话，请不要介意！

03:30.608 --> 03:31.841
Where's that money?
那些钱在哪里？

03:31.908 --> 03:33.808
I'm not feeling any money!
我没感觉有钱啊！

03:33.875 --> 03:35.808
[snap, snap, snap, snap]
- Ooh! Ey! Ah! Ehh!
[啪，啪，啪，啪]
- 哦！哎呀！啊!呃！

03:35.875 --> 03:37.275
- [growls]
- [咆哮]

03:37.341 --> 03:38.641
[snap snap]
[啪啪啪]

03:38.775 --> 03:40.408
- Okay. I brought
plenty of things
- 好的。我带来了
很多东西

03:40.475 --> 03:41.541
for Mr. Krabs to pinch--
让蟹老板捏——

03:41.608 --> 03:42.775
a pinch of salt--
少许盐——

03:42.841 --> 03:44.208
Aah!
[snap]
啊啊！
[折断]

03:44.275 --> 03:45.475
[moans]
[呻吟声]

03:47.108 --> 03:48.508
A baby's cheek!
婴儿的脸颊！

03:48.575 --> 03:49.775
[baby cooing]
[婴儿咕咕声]

03:49.841 --> 03:51.775
[snap]
[baby cooing]
[啪]
[婴儿咕咕声]

03:51.808 --> 03:53.508
[electronic sizzling]
[电子滋滋声]

03:53.575 --> 03:55.141
Lucky that was a robot body.
幸运的是，那是一个机器人身体。

03:55.208 --> 03:56.775
- SpongeBob,
quit fooling around!
- 海绵宝宝，
别胡闹了！

03:56.775 --> 03:59.341
Ow!
[moaning]
噢！
[呻吟]

03:59.408 --> 04:02.775
We need to test his ability
to pinch something tough,
我们需要测试他的能力
捏一些坚硬的东西，

04:02.775 --> 04:04.941
you ninny!
- Tough, huh?
你这个笨蛋！
- 很难吧？

04:05.008 --> 04:06.808
Gosh, the toughest thing
I can think of
天哪，最难的事
我能想到

04:06.875 --> 04:08.808
is...Mr. Krabs himself!
是……先生。蟹蟹本人！

04:11.808 --> 04:13.775
[snap]
- [groaning]
[啪]
- [呻吟]

04:13.808 --> 04:15.408
[shrill scream]
Ohhh!
[尖叫声]
哦哦！

04:15.475 --> 04:16.908
Ooh-ooh-ooh-ooh!
哦哦哦！

04:16.975 --> 04:19.008
Me achin' pinchers!
我好痛啊！

04:19.075 --> 04:21.775
And I didn't even
get any money!
而我什至没有
得到任何钱！

04:21.841 --> 04:22.775
[coin clatters]
[硬币碰撞声]

04:22.841 --> 04:24.675
Hee hee! A penny!
嘻嘻！一分钱！

04:24.775 --> 04:27.008
It's me lucky day!
[giggling]
这是我的幸运日！
[咯咯笑]

04:27.075 --> 04:29.208
- Pinch test failed.
- 挤压测试失败。

04:29.275 --> 04:32.408
Well, maybe he'll do better
on the eye stalk test.
好吧，也许他会做得更好
关于眼柄测试。

04:33.875 --> 04:36.808
[light music]
[轻音乐]

04:36.875 --> 04:39.575
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

04:39.641 --> 04:42.341
- Free suits?
Oh, boy!
- 免费套装？
哦，孩子！

04:43.108 --> 04:46.275
- Welcome, sir.
I--Oh--oh--Uh--shee--
- 欢迎，先生。
我--哦--哦--呃--嘘--

04:46.341 --> 04:49.441
Step up here, and we'll begin.
站到这里，我们就开始吧。

04:51.175 --> 04:53.408
[quietly] Squidward, do you
have the measuring tape?
[小声]章鱼哥，你吗？
有卷尺吗？

04:55.141 --> 04:57.375
Just grabbing
some measurements...
只是抓
一些测量...

04:59.475 --> 05:00.541
Oh!
哦！

05:00.608 --> 05:02.608
- Sir, try to keep still.
- 先生，请保持安静。

05:03.075 --> 05:05.675
[tock, tock, tock, tock]
[嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟，嘟嘟]

05:05.775 --> 05:07.341
[crunch]
- Whoa, there!
[紧缩]
- 哇，在那里！

05:07.408 --> 05:09.575
Don't you need
some other measurements?
你不需要吗
其他一些测量？

05:09.641 --> 05:11.641
I mean, how 'bout me inseam?
我的意思是，我的内缝怎么样？

05:11.775 --> 05:13.108
[jangling]
[叮叮当当]

05:13.175 --> 05:14.608
- Uh, no, you can
put that away, sir.
- 呃，不，你可以
把它收起来，先生。

05:14.675 --> 05:17.008
I'm almost done.
我快完成了。

05:17.075 --> 05:20.775
[light music]
[轻音乐]

05:20.775 --> 05:22.308
- Aah! That's it!
- 啊啊！就是这样！

05:22.375 --> 05:24.641
Get off me,
you terrible tailor!
从我身上下来，
你这个可怕的裁缝！

05:26.775 --> 05:30.575
- Tell your friends about us!
- Not likely!
- 向您的朋友介绍我们！
- 不太可能！

05:30.641 --> 05:33.775
- How'd he do?
- Oh, he didn't make the cut.
- 他怎么样？
- 哦，他没有晋级。

05:33.775 --> 05:35.641
- Of course.
Up next, it says
- 当然。
接下来，它说

05:35.775 --> 05:37.175
we have to get
an X-ray of him.
我们必须得到
他的X光片

05:37.241 --> 05:38.808
Any ideas?
- I do have one plan
有什么想法吗？
- 我确实有一个计划

05:38.875 --> 05:40.008
that might work.
这可能有用。

05:40.075 --> 05:41.441
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

05:41.508 --> 05:43.408
- [grunts]
- Hello there, sir!
- [咕哝]
- 你好，先生！

05:43.475 --> 05:45.675
Are you rightfully afraid
of your own mortality?
你有理由害怕吗
你自己的死亡率？

05:45.775 --> 05:47.541
Wanna make sure
that when you're gone,
想确定一下
当你离开时，

05:47.608 --> 05:49.441
you are not forgotten?
Well, step on up
你是不是被遗忘了？
嗯，继续往上走

05:49.508 --> 05:51.475
and marvel at the latest
technological wonder--
并惊叹于最新的
科技奇迹——

05:51.541 --> 05:54.208
photography!
Preserve your precious punim
摄影！
保护你珍贵的普宁

05:54.275 --> 05:56.008
for generations to come!
为了子孙后代！

05:56.075 --> 05:58.275
Aah...whaaa...
啊啊……哇啊……

05:58.341 --> 06:01.341
Conquer time itself
at absolutely no charge to you!
征服时间本身
绝对不向您收取任何费用！

06:01.408 --> 06:03.408
- No charge, hey?
[spits]
- 不收费，嘿？
[吐口水]

06:03.475 --> 06:06.508
Well...I am very
"photogeneric."
嗯……我很
“上镜。”

06:10.075 --> 06:11.875
Let's see...
让我们来看看...

06:11.941 --> 06:13.241
how do you start this thing?
你如何开始这件事？

06:13.308 --> 06:14.341
Oh! Here we go!
哦！开始了！

06:14.408 --> 06:17.075
[X-ray machine humming]
[X光机嗡嗡声]

06:17.141 --> 06:20.075
Hoo! Gettin' kinda hot
in here!
呼！有点热
在这里！

06:20.141 --> 06:21.775
[chuckles]
[笑声]

06:21.841 --> 06:23.641
Should my underwear
be on fire?
我的内衣应该
着火了吗？

06:23.775 --> 06:25.541
- How many X-rays
of Mr. Krabs do we need?
- 多少次X光检查
我们需要蟹老板吗？

06:25.608 --> 06:28.508
- Just one. How many
did you set it to take?
- 只有一个。有多少
你把它设置为采取吗？

06:28.575 --> 06:30.341
- 25...
- 25...
- 25...
- 25...
- 25...
- 25...
- 25...
- 25...

06:30.408 --> 06:31.841
thousand?
千？

06:31.908 --> 06:34.975
- Uh...this is getting
a little...[gibberish]
- 呃...这越来越
有点……[胡言乱语]

06:35.041 --> 06:37.075
Eh...thank you.
呃……谢谢你。

06:37.141 --> 06:39.141
No more pictures, please.
请不要再发照片了。

06:39.208 --> 06:41.675
[mumbling, whimpering]
[咕哝，呜咽]

06:41.775 --> 06:43.275
[bones clattering]
- Squidward, is his skeleton
[骨头嘎嘎作响]
- 章鱼哥，是他的骷髅

06:43.341 --> 06:45.108
supposed to just
fall apart like that?
应该只是
就这样崩溃了？

06:45.175 --> 06:46.541
- Not at all.
- 一点也不。

06:46.608 --> 06:48.375
On to the next test.
进入下一个测试。

06:49.141 --> 06:51.775
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

06:51.808 --> 06:54.208
Oh...oh...
哦...哦...

06:54.275 --> 06:57.275
Oh, what a day.
哦，多么美好的一天啊。

06:57.341 --> 07:00.275
- Hey, man, you look like
you've had a rough day.
- 嘿，伙计，你看起来像
你这一天过得很艰难。

07:00.341 --> 07:03.041
How'd ya like to chill out
with a nice massage?
你想放松一下吗
有很好的按摩吗？

07:03.108 --> 07:05.175
It's free.
它是免费的。

07:05.241 --> 07:06.908
- Free, huh?
- 免费，是吧？

07:06.975 --> 07:09.341
- Free.
- Eh. Okay.
- 自由的。
- 呃。好的。

07:09.408 --> 07:11.275
Let's get this over with.
让我们结束这一切吧。

07:11.341 --> 07:14.175
- Remember, this is
the cold-blooded test.
-记住，这是
冷血的考验。

07:14.241 --> 07:16.175
Just take his temperature.
量一下他的体温就可以了。

07:16.241 --> 07:17.641
- You got it, best friend.
- 你明白了，最好的朋友。

07:17.775 --> 07:19.175
- Don't call me that.
- 别这么叫我。

07:19.241 --> 07:21.975
- Boop!
- [stammers] Don't you do that!
- 噗！
- [结巴]你别这么做！

07:22.041 --> 07:24.241
- I'm ready!
- 我准备好了！

07:24.308 --> 07:26.208
- All right, man,
let's see if we can, like,
- 好吧，伙计，
让我们看看是否可以，比如

07:26.275 --> 07:28.341
work out some of this
tension.
解决一些这个问题
紧张。

07:28.408 --> 07:31.775
- Why, you--
Oh, no, no, no, no, no!
- 为什么，你--
噢，不，不，不，不，不！

07:31.775 --> 07:33.775
- [panting]
- [气喘吁吁]

07:34.908 --> 07:36.775
- How's the cold-blooded
test going?
- 冷血是怎样的
测试进行吗？

07:36.808 --> 07:38.641
- Great! He's in the freezer
right now.
- 伟大的！他在冰箱里
现在。

07:38.775 --> 07:41.775
- SpongeBob, you moron!
Cold-blooded means your body
- 海绵宝宝，你这个白痴！
冷血意味着你的身体

07:41.775 --> 07:43.941
is the same temperature
as the water around it--
是相同的温度
就像它周围的水一样——

07:44.008 --> 07:46.341
not that you're actually cold!
并不是说你真的很冷！

07:46.408 --> 07:48.075
- [gasps]
[teeth chattering]
- [喘气]
[牙齿打战]

07:48.141 --> 07:49.508
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

07:49.575 --> 07:51.608
Squidward?
章鱼哥？

07:51.675 --> 07:52.875
Whyyyyyy?
为什么yyyyy？

07:52.941 --> 07:54.908
- Oh, Mr. Krabs,
I'm so sorry!
-哦，蟹老板先生，
我很抱歉！

07:54.975 --> 07:57.341
We had to give you your physical
without you knowing,
我们必须给你你的身体
在你不知道的情况下，

07:57.408 --> 07:59.241
or the Krusty Krab
woulda been shut down,
或蟹堡王
会被关闭，

07:59.308 --> 08:00.941
and I'd have to get
a real job!
我必须得到
一份真正的工作！

08:01.008 --> 08:02.675
- All right!
Final test!
- 好的！
最终测试！

08:02.775 --> 08:04.841
Shell durability!
外壳耐用！

08:04.908 --> 08:06.241
Wha-hah!
哇哈！

08:06.308 --> 08:08.108
- No, no, no, no, no, no!
- 不，不，不，不，不，不！

08:08.175 --> 08:09.875
[stammering]
[结巴]

08:09.941 --> 08:13.708
[muffled, lisping] Now you see
why I don't like checkups?
[低沉，口齿不清]现在你明白了
为什么我不喜欢检查？

08:13.775 --> 08:15.475
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

08:15.541 --> 08:17.008
- Don't worry, Mr. Krabs.
- 别担心，蟹老板。

08:17.075 --> 08:18.775
Yes, you failed
every test today,
是的，你失败了
今天的每一次考试，

08:18.841 --> 08:20.608
but Squidward and I
will whip you into shape,
但章鱼哥和我
会鞭打你塑造形状，

08:20.675 --> 08:22.808
even if it takes
the rest of the weekend!
即使需要
周末剩下的时间！

08:22.875 --> 08:25.441
- [sobbing]
- [抽泣]

08:27.108 --> 08:30.975
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

08:31.041 --> 08:33.575
[grunting]
[咕噜声]

08:36.108 --> 08:39.208
- Let's kick it up a notch!
- 让我们更上一层楼吧！

08:39.275 --> 08:41.541
- [grunting]
- [咕哝]

08:41.608 --> 08:43.675
Eeeee!
哎呀！

08:43.741 --> 08:47.041
Guuuuuuhhhh!
咕咕咕啊啊啊！

08:47.108 --> 08:49.108
Whoa--no!
哇——不！

08:49.175 --> 08:51.041
[whimpering]
[呜咽]

08:51.108 --> 08:53.441
Aah...aah!
啊啊……啊啊！

08:53.508 --> 08:55.941
[panting]
[气喘吁吁]

08:56.008 --> 08:57.141
[beep beep]
[嘟嘟]

08:57.208 --> 09:00.608
[upbeat music]
[欢快的音乐]

09:00.675 --> 09:02.741
[hyperventilating]
[换气过度]

09:02.808 --> 09:05.841
[stammering]
Oh--oh--no--oh, jeez--ohh!
[结巴]
哦——哦——不——哦，天哪——哦！

09:10.341 --> 09:11.975
- I don't know what
we did wrong, Squidward.
- 我不知道什么
我们做错了，章鱼哥。

09:12.041 --> 09:14.108
Mr. Krabs
looks worse than before!
蟹老板先生
看起来比以前更糟糕了！

09:14.175 --> 09:16.075
- [moaning]
- [呻吟]

09:16.141 --> 09:20.408
- I guess that nurse is gonna
close the Krusty Krab after all.
- 我猜那个护士会
毕竟关掉蟹堡王吧。

09:20.475 --> 09:21.775
I wish I could say
我希望我能说

09:21.808 --> 09:24.075
it's been a pleasure
working with you.
很高兴
和你一起工作。

09:24.141 --> 09:25.841
- Oh, Squidward,
I'll miss you too!
-哦，章鱼哥，
我也会想念你的！

09:25.908 --> 09:27.008
[sobbing]
[抽泣]

09:27.075 --> 09:28.841
- Quit yer blubberin', boy.
- 别再哭了，孩子。

09:28.908 --> 09:32.108
Me body may be mush,
but me mind's sharp as a tack!
我的身体可能很软弱，
但我的头脑非常敏锐！

09:32.175 --> 09:34.175
And I...have a plan.
我……有一个计划。

09:34.241 --> 09:37.908
[light music]
[轻音乐]

09:37.975 --> 09:40.141
- Good morning!
- 早上好！

09:40.208 --> 09:43.108
I assume your boss
passed his physical?
我假设你的老板
通过了他的体检吗？

09:43.175 --> 09:45.375
- Oh, um...yes.
Of course he did.
- 哦，嗯...是的。
他当然做到了。

09:45.441 --> 09:48.175
Um, unfortunately,
our results were--
嗯，不幸的是，
我们的结果是——

09:48.241 --> 09:50.108
- Uh, eaten!
- Yeah, yeah.
- 呃，吃饱了！
- 是啊是啊。

09:50.175 --> 09:52.441
Um, anyway,
we thought you could
嗯，无论如何，
我们认为你可以

09:52.508 --> 09:55.675
give old Mr. K
another exam yourself.
给老K先生
自己再做一次考试。

09:55.775 --> 09:56.908
He's in his office.
他在他的办公室里。

09:56.975 --> 09:58.608
- Hmm...
- 唔...

09:58.675 --> 09:59.875
Very well.
很好。

10:02.808 --> 10:05.275
[drilling sound, horn honks,
thud, cracking]
[钻孔声、喇叭声、
砰的一声，破裂]

10:05.341 --> 10:07.308
Mr. Krabs...
蟹老板...

10:07.375 --> 10:10.008
not only did you
pass your exam,
你不仅
通过考试，

10:10.075 --> 10:11.775
you might be the most
你可能是最

10:11.775 --> 10:15.108
astonishingly excellent physical
specimen I've ever seen!
身体素质惊人的优秀
我见过的标本！

10:15.175 --> 10:16.975
[laughs]
both: Whew!
[笑]
两人：唷！

10:17.041 --> 10:18.941
- My name is Mr. Krabs,
- 我叫蟹老板先生

10:19.008 --> 10:20.641
and I love money!
我爱钱！

10:20.775 --> 10:24.241
- Yes. You said so several times
during the examination.
- 是的。你说过好几次了
考试期间。

10:24.308 --> 10:26.408
- [forced laugh]
Ack, ack, ack, ack, ack,
- [强笑]
确认，确认，确认，确认，确认，

10:26.475 --> 10:30.175
- I suppose I won't need to
close your restaurant today.
- 我想我不需要
今天关闭您的餐厅。

10:30.241 --> 10:31.941
See you next year.
明年见。

10:32.008 --> 10:33.775
- Whoo-hoo!
We did it, boys!
- 呼呼！
我们做到了，孩子们！

10:33.808 --> 10:36.475
The Krusty Krab
lives to see another day!
蟹堡王
活着就是为了再见到另一天！

10:36.541 --> 10:38.975
Three cheers
for a successful ruse!
三声欢呼
为了成功的诡计！

10:39.041 --> 10:40.375
- Let's just make it one.
- 让我们合而为一吧。

10:40.441 --> 10:41.941
both: Hip, hip, hooray!
两者：时髦，时髦，万岁！

10:42.008 --> 10:43.641
- So, you said there would be
- 所以，你说会有

10:43.775 --> 10:45.775
some money in this for me?
- [squeals]
给我一些钱吗？
- [尖叫声]

10:45.808 --> 10:49.441
* *
**
**
**
**
**
**
**

10:49.508 --> 10:51.041
[crazed laughter]
[glass shatters]
[疯狂的笑声]
[玻璃碎裂]

10:51.108 --> 10:52.775
- You'll never get me money!
- 你永远不会给我钱！

10:52.775 --> 10:54.541
Ah ha ha ha ha ha!
啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！

啊哈哈哈哈哈哈！